      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-k/q8-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"The female and right-handed region has probability 0.54 . [A1] (c) P(F | L) = 0.06/0.11 . [M1] [A1] = 6/11 (d) P(L | F ′) = 0.05/0.40 . [M1] [A1] = 0.125\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
